WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Sam Whitfield: The vendor flagged a lower than expected auto-enrollment opt-out rate, which is good news.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Maria Chen: Do we know if that's related to the recent employee communication campaign?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Sam Whitfield: Likely yes, enrollment emails went out right before the auto-enrollment window closed.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Maria Chen: Let's keep that cadence for the next plan year and measure the impact again.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Sam Whitfield: I'll document that in the enrollment guide update for next year.
